    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; low-grade temperature; no rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Wheeze, chest tightness, dry cough and night waking; no hemoptysis</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore throat and clear nasal discharge</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

